config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_EWPE_SMART_MQTT
	bool "Domoticz plugin: EWPE Smart air conditioners (MQTT)"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_PYCRYPTODOME
	default n
	help
		control of the EWPE Smart/Gree air conditioners over MQTT, with encrypted commands (it encrypts the commands with pycryptodome and ships its own MQTT client).

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/ewpe-smart-mqtt, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		Setup -> Hardware -> EWPE Smart MQTT, enter the MQTT broker and the device.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
